          <datasource-dependencies datasource="federated.db591f0d94dd5d62eab9577b"><column caption="Année" datatype="integer" name="[annee]" role="dimension" type="ordinal" /><column caption="Code SH" datatype="string" name="[code_sh]" role="dimension" type="nominal" /><column caption="Valeur (CHF)" datatype="real" name="[valeur_chf]" role="measure" type="quantitative" /><column caption="Automatiques (Mrd CHF)" datatype="real" default-format="n#,##0.00" name="[Calc_LuxeValeur]" role="measure" type="quantitative"><calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM(IF [annee] = [Parameters].[Parameter 1] AND ([code_sh] = "910121" OR [code_sh] = "910221") THEN [valeur_chf] END) / 1000000000' /></column><column caption="Part de l'or dans les automatiques" datatype="real" default-format="p0.0%" name="[Calc_LuxeOr]" role="measure" type="quantitative"><calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM(IF [annee] = [Parameters].[Parameter 1] AND [code_sh] = "910121" THEN [valeur_chf] END) / ([Calc_LuxeValeur] * 1000000000)' /></column><column-instance column="[Calc_LuxeOr]" derivation="User" name="[usr:Calc_LuxeOr:qk]" pivot='key' type="quantitative" /></datasource-dependencies>
          
          
          
